Article 4: The tax rates of city maintenance and construction tax are as follows:
(1) Where the taxpayer is located in a city proper, the tax rate is 7%;
(2) Where the taxpayer is located in a county seat or a town, the tax rate is 5%;
(3) Where the taxpayer is located outside a city proper, a county seat or a town, the tax rate is 1%.
The term "location of the taxpayer" in the preceding paragraph means the domicile of the taxpayer or other places related to the production and business activities of the taxpayer, and the specific location shall be determined by the province, autonomous region, or municipality directly under the Central Government.
